usercontent.com/u/194539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1915,"digest":"sha256:fad389743019190c24395c2fc7fc6ab5a10cedece32b9b308c990ad31c80ce3d","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-22T22:48:48Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T22:48:48Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.86.0/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.86.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.86.0","body":"## RevealLine v0.86.0 — stronger mission pressure and playtest controls\n\nSolo, Versus and Team now share deterministic pressure presets with clearer Gentle, Standard and Expert selection from the main menu. In Settings, administrators can enable bounded Custom speed and density tuning for playtesting, then apply or reset it without changing saved progression or replay identity. Non-default admin playtests do not grant normal awards. Image-loading failures now identify the affected asset and processing stage; the previously reported PNG/JPEG failure was not reproduced and is not claimed fixed.\n\nSource: `c311e91b886c55039cda6e335a7408de8650110f` (tree `66f4e86dce3112ddb9124f3953db699e3b7bb7c4`), merged through [PR #278](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/pull/278).\n\nThe exact-head [PR checks](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35791629415) passed preflight and the ordinary production build. The actual merged-source [qualification and freeze](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35792659821) passed source identity, validation, lint, formatting, native formatting, motion syntax, production reproduction/readiness and the immutable freeze. Automated suites were explicitly waived under the temporary reviewed policy; no passing full-suite verdict is claimed.\n\nThe guarded read-only [artifact inspection](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35793696240) verified every Git source blob/type/mode and source TAR commit, every distribution manifest byte and hash chain, and the bounded offline inventory. The shipped manifest contains the exact frozen distribution graph.\n\nOriginal distribution: 591,054,107 bytes, SHA-256 `22d854dd9647a5de1f5134f396e6823f4e207ffb7b683aba63a1fce9cfcad255`.\n\nOriginal source archive: 1,613,864,960 bytes, SHA-256 `1e5c0d9ca579b429ea9da05f16d3906c53e4c957856f4511ec36c6888dc03f15`.\n\nPages selection, Archive54 preservation, public byte verification and bounded browser checks remain separate acceptance gates until the selector PR is merged and the deployed site is checked. Physical controllers, physical touch, cold-offline use, full campaign balance and musical/listening acceptance are not claimed by this release package.\n"}